        <mxCell id="e_s1_3" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_exec" style="endArrow=block;html=1;fontColor=#333333;" target="p_hook" value="3: if hook set, statementHook_(stmt, depth) - lets a Debugger observe every statement before it runs (see tab 12)">
